{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/5d77a12be0daea06a6d7e5c2fb4b01a5.avif?t=1769259310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras_big/5d77a12be0daea06a6d7e5c2fb4b01a5.avif?t=1769259310 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure with KIND</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KIND are beings that can speak and possess intelligence similar to humans. In the very distant past, they were depicted as divine entities, and later portrayed as monsters or spirits. Some KIND possess strength far greater than humans, while others can run on water. These mysterious beings are rarely seen in cities, but appear quite commonly in the countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/95b063917af473a5e05b5ab975084aaf.avif?t=1769259310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras_big/95b063917af473a5e05b5ab975084aaf.avif?t=1769259310 width=800 height=1070 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visiting your grandmother's house in the countryside for your elementary school's founding day holiday, you get lost in a forest said to have a magical well, where you encounter KIND Barabin, an explorer who resembles a kidney bean. Explorer Barabin never leaves anyone in trouble behind. Your journey to return to grandmother's house begins with him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/2b570f53a30613db079618e209c006bb.avif?t=1769259310\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/33be9d3f85f4a9ac383d7961ec6e1fba.avif?t=1769259310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras_big/33be9d3f85f4a9ac383d7961ec6e1fba.avif?t=1769259310 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/8b1ddcf0316fd6ccbc935df853b2ff28.avif?t=1769259310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras_big/8b1ddcf0316fd6ccbc935df853b2ff28.avif?t=1769259310 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/3c57e922d95fc79b28a3d7b6c015eb5a.poster.avif?t=1769259310\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/3c57e922d95fc79b28a3d7b6c015eb5a.webm?t=1769259310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/3c57e922d95fc79b28a3d7b6c015eb5a.mp4?t=1769259310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your adventure is filled with</strong> unexplained weather anomalies and strange events. Crossing frozen lakes covered in heavy snow, climbing over earthquake-struck mountains\u2014 what other events will unfold before you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/618a83054e6d7740fd65929b